Package: lab4
Type: Package
Title: Lab 4: Sampling Distributions and Confidence Intervals
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Wyatt", "Au", , "wyatt_au@protonmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Lab 4 group tasks as a reproducible package. Ships the
    two synthetic survey populations used in the lab (global_monitor,
    us_adults), a deterministic sampling-distribution simulator
    (sample_props()), a Wald confidence-interval helper (prop_ci()),
    and a vignette that works through every task with its answers.
